[[The Battle Cats]] has a massive amount of '''merchandise'''. This article and its subpages aim to compile all official merchandise. Do be aware that there is fake merchandise that is not officially made by [[PONOS Corporation|PONOS]].

Fake merchandise is usually promoted by bots on a website or by people attempting to make some quick money, and are mostly of poor quality using stolen/traced artwork.

